  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk_1fba8701",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "{PlayerName}，在今州有什么不了解、不适应的随时可以来找我。并不是因为你的客人身份才这么说的，只是觉得……你失去记忆又只身一人，或许会有需要我的时候。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "keywords": [
          "心声1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_26da5c04",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "成为踏白后，我在野外见过形形色色许多人。他们有的行色匆匆，却不知道为何忙碌，最终迷失在途中。相反，那些目标明确的出行者，哪怕迂回而吃力，哪怕偶有停滞，总能一点一点到达想去的地方。我希望我会是后者，而离开家乡来到今州就是我迈出的第一步。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1,
        "keywords": [
          "心声2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5b78cf43",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "从记事时起，我就能听见风说的话，流息。它们并非空气振动时发出的声响，也不是某种具象的对话声，但只要我沉下心来，触摸那些无形的流淌着的气流，就能感知到曾暴露在风场中的信息。就在刚刚，流淌在耳边的风，又和我说了一个有趣的故事，你想要听听看吗？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 2,
        "keywords": [
          "心声3"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_99ea34bf",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "每当流息从你身旁经过，就会变得很不寻常，仿佛一旦靠近就会不由自主被你牵引，失去控制。我不知道这究竟意味着什么，但我很确定不管是什么，我都不想只是站在一旁看着。可以的话，我想和你一起面对可能的一切。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 3,
        "keywords": [
          "心声4"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_fd531421",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "需要的时候，就呼唤我的名字吧。从荒芜之地到生机之所，从最初的起点到最后的结局……无论尽头处等待我们的究竟是什么，无论你会引发怎样的暴风雨，只要你愿意，我就会陪你一同见证。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 4,
        "keywords": [
          "心声5"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_1a79c5f6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "歌声，是从心底迸发出的共鸣，它会传递最真挚的心情。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 5,
        "keywords": [
          "秧秧的喜好"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c5958d29",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "虽然总想着为大家做到更多更多，但超出承受的限度……反而会给自己、给无法回馈的他人造成困扰吧？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 6,
        "keywords": [
          "秧秧的烦恼"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5b92d684",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "潮饼在瑝珑称得上家喻户晓，但各地做法却有不同。今州的潮饼已经很美味了，但在我心中，还是家里做的更胜一筹……有机会的话，带你回家尝尝母亲的手艺吧？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 7,
        "keywords": [
          "喜欢的食物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_4044a539",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "任何食物都该被好好对待吧？欸？黑，黑暗料理的话……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 8,
        "keywords": [
          "讨厌的食物"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e3304319",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "美好的事物让人心生向往，但不够美好的那些部分也是真实存在着的。我不想只是沉溺在安逸中，享受着他人的保护，我必须……亲自面对没那么完满但足够真实的东西，成为能够保护他人、给予他人的人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 9,
        "keywords": [
          "抱负和理想"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_80254b15",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "对我的发带有点在意？这是我前往今州时，母亲送我的临别礼物。对我而言，它象征着一段旅途的开始，纪念着属于我的新生。我希望，它能一直提醒我“践行自己心意”这件事。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 10,
        "keywords": [
          "凝音1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8ee9417b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "敏锐的感知曾经令我非常痛苦。讯息从四面八方涌来，嘈杂、紊乱、猛烈，而我只是风暴中的一片落羽。不过，没关系……都过去了，我已经找到了稳住方向的诀窍，也由此，发现了你。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 23,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 24,
        "xlsx_section_index": 11,
        "keywords": [
          "凝音2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7358d3ba",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在充斥着铁锈味与失去的前线上，是他一次又一次挡在所有人面前，做出决断。作为全体夜归的倚靠，作为指引旌旗的青龙，他所背负的那份沉重，是我们难以想象的。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 25,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 26,
        "xlsx_section_index": 12,
        "keywords": [
          "关于忌炎"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_9883c59a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“有问题，找正义伙伴炽霞”，这可不是一句玩笑话。高涨的热情，超凡的身手，满满的精力……英雄戏里主角该有的一切，她已经统统具备了。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 27,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 28,
        "xlsx_section_index": 13,
        "keywords": [
          "关于炽霞"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8d5d7bc7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "白芷对世界有着自己的解读，说话做事也会遵循自己认同的方式，但她并不是严于待人的人，靠近她向她求助的话，你会在她脸上看到一晃而过的惊讶，但绝对绝对不会拒绝你。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 29,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 30,
        "xlsx_section_index": 14,
        "keywords": [
          "关于白芷"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_459d730f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "野外执勤的时候，我曾和她打过几次照面。她的身上有着一股侠气，知道何时该挥剑，知道为何而挥剑，尽管年纪尚小，但她已经像自己所求的世界一般，清正分明。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 31,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 32,
        "xlsx_section_index": 15,
        "keywords": [
          "关于丹瑾"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_cc4b1f18",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "桃祈身上有一种举重若轻的气度，好像不管什么突发情况，她都能不紧不慢地掏出几个方案，留下一句“别慌~这样不就解决了嘛~”。所谓懒散，一定是因为她在我们看不见的地方做了十足的努力吧。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 33,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 34,
        "xlsx_section_index": 16,
        "keywords": [
          "关于桃祈"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c963046c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "今天是个特别的日子，是属于你的纪念日，所以…祝你生日快乐，祝你生日快乐，祝你生日快乐…这一个生日、下一个生日、下下个生日，希望我都能为你唱起这首歌。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 35,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 36,
        "xlsx_section_index": 17,
        "keywords": [
          "生日祝福"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_18ce6349",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "轻飘飘、慢悠悠…你会飘向哪里?",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 37,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 38,
        "xlsx_section_index": 18,
        "keywords": [
          "闲趣1（待机动作）"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a40345e6",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "（语气词）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 39,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 40,
        "xlsx_section_index": 19,
        "keywords": [
          "闲趣2（待机动作）"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_084071ef",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "聚散有时，不用太介怀。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 41,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 42,
        "xlsx_section_index": 20,
        "keywords": [
          "闲趣3（待机动作）"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2e38a08a",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "我叫秧秧，夜归下属临时踏白，负责调查发生的异常。万事万物，凡是暴露在流息中的，我都能有所感知。所以遇到什么不对劲的，不要自己硬扛，第一时间告诉我，好吗？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 43,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 44,
        "xlsx_section_index": 21,
        "keywords": [
          "自我介绍"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_03597fe9",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "流息指引我们相遇……我有预感，我们会成为彼此的旅伴。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 45,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 46,
        "xlsx_section_index": 22,
        "keywords": [
          "初奏"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c10b5900",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "一起抵达更远的地方吧。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 47,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 48,
        "xlsx_section_index": 23,
        "keywords": [
          "入队1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_51309754",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "云雀的歌，即将唱响。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 49,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 50,
        "xlsx_section_index": 24,
        "keywords": [
          "入队2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_43435144",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "我会尽我所能，成为大家的慰藉。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 51,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 52,
        "xlsx_section_index": 25,
        "keywords": [
          "入队3"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_07a19c18",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "流息越发强烈，它……想告诉我什么呢？",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 53,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 54,
        "xlsx_section_index": 26,
        "keywords": [
          "突破1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_994a18b5",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "我从没感受过这样充盈的力量……是因为你，对吗？谢谢你，{PlayerName}。谢谢你……为我所做的一切。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 55,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 56,
        "xlsx_section_index": 27,
        "keywords": [
          "突破2"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b95b58e0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "流息从四周聚集，而我站在中心，等待着起风的时机。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 57,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 58,
        "xlsx_section_index": 28,
        "keywords": [
          "突破3"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_577124ac",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "越过风雨，向美好献上颂歌…此时此刻，是云雀离天空最近的时候。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 59,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 60,
        "xlsx_section_index": 29,
        "keywords": [
          "突破4"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3014e9a1",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "已经够了，{PlayerName}，你为我做的一切已经很多了。之后的日子，请安心待在我的身后，让我来为你做些什么吧？因为……我希望自己可以是那个接纳你所有、分担你所有的人。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
